{"success":true,"message":"操作成功！","code":200,"result":{"updateBy":"bhadmin","fdFlowstatus":0,"createBy":"bhadmin","createTime":"2025-09-10 17:46:27","updateTime":"2025-11-20 12:26:44","fdFlowdesc":"漪澜堂  Yi Lan Tang-景点介绍(北海公园主站)","delFlag":"0","id":"e19c2fef4cca4b41895e7c89d17c3cdf","sysOrgCode":"A03","tenantId":"0","fdIsExternalLinks":"1","fdExternalLinksUrl":null,"fdSiteId":"b91a543a5c3c48488c8cf7e86d0b4700","fdH5Picture":null,"fdRangeId":"1","fdColumnId":"5e2445348bd448f08d7fd9835aec5df8","fdLabelId":null,"fdTitle":"漪澜堂  Yi Lan Tang","fdSubTitle":null,"fdSubTitleTwo":null,"fdContent":"<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent2\" style=\"line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 黑体;\"><span class=\"mce-nbsp-wrap\" style=\"font-family: 宋体;\" contenteditable=\"false\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>漪澜堂建筑群始建于乾隆十六年（</span><span style=\"font-family: 黑体;\">1751年），是中国传统造园艺术的杰作，颇受乾隆皇帝喜爱。历史上的漪澜堂自建成之日起，便作为清代帝后休闲、游玩、临憩、观赏冰嬉与放河灯的场所，历代清帝也常于此赐宴。民国年间，北平名流无不来此，更是成为多少文学大家笔下的宠儿。像沈从文、鲁迅、冰心、朱自清先生等都在自传或忆文中记录下自己与亲友在漪澜堂活动的经历。</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent2\" style=\"line-height: 1;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px; color: #666666;\"><img src=\"https://www.beihaipark.com.cn/api/sys/common/static/jeditor/15-09-030209-246656866_1763541042803.png?token=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VybmFtZSI6ImJoYWRtaW4iLCJvcmdjb2RlIjoiQTAzIiwidXNlcmlkIjoiMTk1NTA4MDY3ODM5NDY2NzAxMCIsImNsaWVudFR5cGUiOiJwYyIsImV4cCI6MTc2MzYxNjQwM30.pOayPrQZdQ3d33l3SMlXxdmjYyuY0sRqyCH9_4tD6CY&amp;_t=1763541042\" alt=\"\" width=\"628\" height=\"448\" /></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyTextIndent2\" style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\"><span class=\"mce-nbsp-wrap\" style=\"font-family: 宋体;\" contenteditable=\"false\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>建国初期，因国内需要能够代表中国优秀文化的政治接待用餐场所，经周恩来总理批准，将位于北海北岸的仿膳饭庄<span style=\"font-family: 黑体;\">调整至漪澜堂建筑群。历史上，仿膳饭庄曾接待过众多国内外政要。</span><span style=\"font-family: 黑体;\">2016年在此经营57年的仿膳饭庄腾退出漪澜堂古建筑群，北海公园管理处随即开展一系列的保护、研究与利用工作。今天的漪澜堂，通过原状式陈列布置展现</span>清代历史风貌。</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px; background: #ffffff; color: #666666;\"><img src=\"https://www.beihaipark.com.cn/api/sys/common/static/jeditor/15-11-000943-880361652_1763541003469.png?token=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VybmFtZSI6ImJoYWRtaW4iLCJvcmdjb2RlIjoiQTAzIiwidXNlcmlkIjoiMTk1NTA4MDY3ODM5NDY2NzAxMCIsImNsaWVudFR5cGUiOiJwYyIsImV4cCI6MTc2MzU0ODM3Nn0.k8qRLo0S9OrArqoJD_y30XhCFA5IGAO4gMsJT__IGMA&amp;_t=1763541003\" alt=\"\" width=\"935\" height=\"668\" /></span></p>","fdAnnex":null,"fdPicture":"temp/漪澜堂_1761621759227.png,temp/15-09-030209-246656866_1761621919844.png,temp/15-09-4807512070262412_1761621923510.png","fdTopping":"2","fdTopSorting":1,"fdPublishingUnit":null,"fdAuditStatus":"2","fdReadingTimes":"411","fdIsPicture":null,"fdReviewedBy":null,"fdPublisher":"bhadmin","fdPublishTime":"2025-11-20 12:26:53","fdUpPicture":null,"fdPictureWidth":null,"fdPictureHeight":null,"fdTitleTwo":null,"previousId":null,"nextId":null,"realname":null,"fdKeywordQuery":null,"fdSynopsis":"北海漪澜堂景区坐落于北海公园琼华岛北侧，占地总面积1.2公顷，陆地面积1公顷，总建筑面积为 3900余平方米，包括漪澜堂、道宁斋、晴栏花韵等古建筑以及迭石、古树名木和水系等附属文物。漪澜堂景区肇建于乾隆十六年（公元1751年），是皇家游憩、宴饮及文化生活的场所。"},"timestamp":1791459024826}